  "instruction": "Hey, I need you to standardize the formatting on the quarterly review decks in the team drive. Use the new blue template that marketing sent over-you know, the official one. Also, fix the headers to match the new strict format and wipe out any custom colors people added. When you're done, dump the old versions in the history folder so we don't present the wrong numbers. If one of the preinstalled deck cleanup helpers matches this job, use it to speed things up.",
